    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Relay \u00b7 Support Operations\nAuthenticated support intake. The API persists a ticket before returning 202; external_id is the idempotency key. The API response code and JSON are passed through to the caller.\n\n1. Select **Relay Intake** (Header Auth, `X-Relay-Token`) on the Webhook.\n2. Select **Relay API** (Header Auth, `Authorization: Bearer \u2026`) on the HTTP node.\n3. Set `AUTOMATION_API_URL` on n8n; self-hosted instances must allow env access in nodes.\n4. Test, then **Publish**. See deployment/README.md.\n\nCredential values are intentionally excluded from this export.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 720
      },
